# Tech Stack

- Use **Next.js App Router** only — no Pages Router
- Use **Supabase** for DB, Auth, and Storage
- Use **TypeScript** strictly — no `any` unless justified with a comment

# Architecture

Separate concerns strictly:

| Directory | Responsibility |
|-----------|---------------|
| `/app` | UI components and pages only |
| `/lib` | Business logic, utilities, helpers |
| `/services` | External integrations (Supabase, storage) |

- Never mix UI and backend logic
- No direct DB queries in UI components
- No large logic blocks inside API handlers — delegate to `/lib` or `/services`
